t the a13  chip like others have been reporting and  i would much rather have that  than a 10.5 inch display and then that  would mean that the  full modern redesign with rounded  corners on the display  could actually come next year which  would make a ton of sense  since it's going to be the 10th  generation ipad which is perfect for a  new redesign  and if the second scenario plays out  here is my alternative list of specs and  features  complete with a 10.2 inch laminated  display  the a13 chip with 4 gigs of ram  but probably still a 329 starting price  with 32 gigs of base storage but anyway  those are the latest leaks and rumors on  the ipad 9  including my personal thoughts on the  features and the specs  and if you totally disagree with me then  go ahead and leave your comments and  thoughts  down below but if you enjoyed the video  go ahead and tap the like button and  click the circle above to subscribe  for more videos like this one definitely  check out one of those two right there  thanks for watching and we'll see you in  the next video

